    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a dark corner of a sealed laboratory in the bowels of the LATMUS Signal Array Base, a homunculus is born\u2026</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the inhospitable maintenance floors of an extraterrestrial moon base.\u00a0 Defend yourself from the unrelenting pursuit of inhuman abominations using whatever weaponry you can get your hands on.\u00a0 Hunt for materials and tools to increase chances of survival and open up new paths through the base.\u00a0 Scavenge leftover medical supplies to treat the ever present sickness bearing down on you. Sneak past automated security measures designed to maim and kill trespassers.\u00a0 Distract, trap, and attack your foes with an assortment of discarded, makeshift, and environmental tools.\u00a0 Race against time as you run out of fuel for the various utilities in the base, and medicine to soothe your fever.\u00a0 Fight back against the almost certain doom that awaits you, child of Endymion.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a dark corner of a sealed laboratory in the bowels of the LATMUS Signal Array Base, a homunculus is born\u2026</i>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the inhospitable maintenance floors of an extraterrestrial moon base.\u00a0 Defend yourself from the unrelenting pursuit of inhuman abominations using whatever weaponry you can get your hands on.\u00a0 Hunt for materials and tools to increase chances of survival and open up new paths through the base.\u00a0 Scavenge leftover medical supplies to treat the ever present sickness bearing down on you. Sneak past automated security measures designed to maim and kill trespassers.\u00a0 Distract, trap, and attack your foes with an assortment of discarded, makeshift, and environmental tools.\u00a0 Race against time as you run out of fuel for the various utilities in the base, and medicine to soothe your fever.\u00a0 Fight back against the almost certain doom that awaits you, child of Endymion.</p>",
    "short_description": "Selenetrope is a survival horror game where you play as a lab grown homunculus struggling to survive in a base below the surface of an exoplanetary moon. Battle your insane and misbegotten brothers and stave off a raging fever that threatens to destroy you from within.",
